/-!
# Ordered sub-Gaussian maximal envelopes

This directory provides deterministic Gaussian-tail estimates, finite-maximum
tail and layer-cake bridges, and the resulting logarithmic expected-maximum
envelope for finite ordered sub-Gaussian families with polynomially decaying
variance proxies.  No independence assumption is used.
-/
